WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.770
Sweets

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.910
No matter how you stir it, it's still just water.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.110
I told you to suspend your disbelief!

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.660
You expect me to do that without sweets?

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.310
This is just playing pretend.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.750
Look, there are sweet rice cakes up here.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.260
Rice cakes?!

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.260
Rice cakes!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.640
Here!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.680
Ren, those are BB pellets.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.020
This is just too sad!

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:58.070
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:58.070
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.580
I decided this myself

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.580
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.090
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.050
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:20.970
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:25.890
The future is opening up to me like a vast river

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:30.190
Even if sailing straight is difficult,

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.530
I will hold my head high

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.200
I'll change my life,

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.240
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:46.080
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:52.000
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.720
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.440
No amount of begging will work.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.620
We can't afford to spend any more money on tea or sweets.

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.110
Oh, come on!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:27.120
The Get Wet Strategy is Now Underway.

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.660
The school fair is coming up!

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.710
Let's buy some sweets to liven things up!

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.780
C'mon, you can scrounge up a little dough for sweets.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.180
Well, maybe a little...

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.010
But it's all reserved for the 24-hour tournament!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:38.510
This?

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.140
So how much will be left for the school fair?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.420
Nothing!

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.680
We won't have a penny for the school fair!

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.160
You want to go to the 24-hour tournament, right?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.560
Yeah!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.290
So, what choice do we have?

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.570
Come on!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.280
I want the tournament and the fair!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.740
I want 'em both!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.360
What are you, five?

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.320
Hold on, we can swing both.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:09.250
We'll use the money meant for the tournament on the school fair.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.000
School Fair

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.000
School Fair

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.170
24-Hour-Long
Endurance
Tournament

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.510
That way, we could do both!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.160
We could!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:22.220
Great idea, Sono!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.100
You're a financial genius!

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.850
I see a house of cards in the making...

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.340
Strike while the iron's hot!

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.690
Now let's plan out what we'll need for the festival!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.530
Yeah!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.110
Goldfish Scooping

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.860
Haunted Mansion

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.860
Fried Chicken

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.860
Coffee Lounge

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.860
Games

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.860
All right, that settles it.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.750
Wanna head back to our rooms?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.870
Okay.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.860
Where did Rento go?

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.870
Maybe she's already back in her room?

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.870
Hey there.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.420
I've got something for you.

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.670
This is much classier.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.250
Haunted Mansion

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.770
Fried Chicken

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.770
Coffee Lounge

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.770
Haunted Mansion

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.770
Goldfish Scooping

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.770
Games

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.340
This was a better idea anyway.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.020
What's wrong?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:32.960
Stella Academy

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:35.370
The 61st

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:35.370
Hydrangea
Festival

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.840
I repeat.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.640
The school day is now over.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.620
This is a disaster!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:05:00.780
Now we don't have money for the fair or the tournament!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.750
And we only have three days left!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.070
What now?!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.610
Give me an answer!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.900
How should I know?

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:14.210
Um, it's a bit late to ask, but for reference, what did you do last year?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.460
A flag dance, I think.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.710
We have pictures!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:19.700
Look.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.090
Kari never managed to get this part right.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.010
She always skipped practice.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:32.520
I-I thought I'd just be bothering everyone else...

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.230
You only made three mistakes during the performance, though.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.480
Yeah! I'm pretty talented, aren't I?

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.820
It was a lot of fun.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.860
I'd do it again.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.590
Well, it's too late now.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:48.650
Remember how we had to rehearse for an entire month?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.110
Yeah, we did.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.700
Sure takes me back.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.450
Has it already been a year?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.750
Yura.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:05.800
What did you do during fairs in middle school?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:09.550
I think it was... frying noodles, maybe?

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.420
Nothing unusual, anyway.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.670
Wha' now?

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.620
What can we work with?

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.070
All we've got is...

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.480
Tea sets...

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.240
Guns...

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.240
And cosplay outfits?

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.170
So, we could do—

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.620
A cosplay firing range café!

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.240
Hell yeah!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.390
But is three days enough time?

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:41.250
Karira, don't worry about having enough time.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.170
You have to make the time be enough!

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:46.400
I'd vote for you!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:53.720
Our airsoft spirit will persevere!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.770
Stella Academy

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.770
The 61st

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.770
Hydrangea
Festival

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.680
Behold!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.340
What's this?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.800
A lean, mean, shooting machine.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.010
Machine?

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.900
All right, lift it carefully.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.250
Just a little more.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.100
Okay.

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.270
Got targets?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.630
Karira went to copy them.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.770
I see.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.780
This'll do, then.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.000
Yura, take a shot.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.280
Okay.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:06.380
Nice. Good shots.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.980
So, ain't it great?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.840
I borrowed it from an actual firing range.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.440
I'm amazed you got it from them.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:18.170
A friend of a friend has a cousin whose second cousin works there.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.010
You have some weird connections.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.560
Here I am!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.560
I got us some ice cream!

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:33.140
I wonder how many customers we'll get.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:35.660
Each one'll be always right!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:38.530
I'm just glad we could finish setting it up in time.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.520
I can't wait for tomorrow!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:42.830
Me too.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:44.540
win

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.900
Nice!

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.050
Mine's a winner, too!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.570
Let's make some money tomorrow.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:17.680
Yeah.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:33.300
Stella Girls' Academy

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:33.300
School Fair

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.800
Fried Chicken

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.560
Want to shoot?

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.070
Shoot as much as you want! Any gun!

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:01.550
Is this your first time with an airsoft gun?

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:02.580
Yeah.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:03.900
It's easy.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.080
When you hold it like this...

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.330
We're not really getting many customers, huh?

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.420
We have the Judo club next door,

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.170
and rhythmic sports gymnastics club across from us.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:16.810
This is bad.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:20.800
Considering that everyone flocks to the food stalls around lunch break,

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.750
in the next hour, we'll get...

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.020
three customers!

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.370
Aim a little higher.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.350
Okay.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.230
Like this.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:37.650
I'm sorry, but intensive lessons cost extra.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:42.070
Guiding one of your hands while you're firing is another...

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.160
500 yen.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:46.820
Holding them both and in the process embracing you in a vaguely suggestive way costs...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.040
2000 yen!

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:51.490
Sure thing.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:52.590
My pleasure.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:55.510
Incidentally, there's also a 1000 yen charge if you want someone specific to help.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.550
Sure.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.060
Thanks again.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:00.620
Hey, don't rip him off.

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:07.020
I see you're holding out.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.780
You two look pretty fancy.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:10.980
Who are you?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.270
We can sing and dance.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.030
We're The Opera Club!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:21.250
Seikou Academy, The O.C.!

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:25.140
The O.C. is short for The Opera Club.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.310
I'm the club president, Daishichi.

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.730
This is Aira.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.610
Nice to meet you.

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.750
Thank you for being so nice to Karira.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.700
Do you know him, Karira?

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:38.740
H-He's my twin brother.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:43.260
She kept insisting that I come.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:46.120
Th-That's not how it was!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:49.180
I just said you could come if you wanted.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:53.850
Well, I bet we're going to face you in the 24-hour tournament.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.770
We had to gather some intel.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:59.280
Huh? I thought you were into operas.

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:02.610
We are, but we also like airsoft.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.570
Right, Karira.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.530
Haruna said she'd be there for the 24-hour tournament too.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.880
She serious?

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.880
I'll totally whoop her!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.110
<i>Haruna Rin...</i>

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.740
Is something wrong?

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.050
Oh, no, not really.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.840
That's it for us, then.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:26.840
Ciao.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.610
<i>We'll have a rematch with her.</i>

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.560
<i>This time, I'll...</i>

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.460
You're too good for me.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.750
I can't win this.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:40.340
So, how about you get fifteen pellets while I get five?

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.460
Seriously?

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.840
Okay, I might stand a chance then!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.750
Gonna be my pleasure.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:51.080
However... if you miss every shot, you'll have to pay extra!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.870
No sweat. I've got fifteen pellets.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:05.010
All right, if we rip off more customers, they'll start avoiding us like the plague.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.960
Which means we're down to our last resort.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.500
Be amazed.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.560
I call it...

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.620
The Get Wet Strategy!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.770
The Get Wet Strategy?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.190
Get cracking!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.370
Come near! Come look!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.790
This is the legendary quick draw show by the C3 club!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:40.320
It will fall apart immediately should it get wet!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.960
Let us begin!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.470
Come on in!

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:50.280
Hey, why am I playing the poster girl here?

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.840
Why not? You're taking center stage!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:55.680
Oh, I'm but a moth to the flame of those words...

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.400
You're not getting away!

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.810
Yachiyo wins!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.340
I lost.

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.960
Nice job, Yachiyo.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:23.130
Well, customers are getting more bang for their buck if Ren loses and shows some skin, anyway.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.630
Who here said my boobs were small?

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.380
Nobody did!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.130
The next show starts at two.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.640
Iced coffee and black tea it is, then.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.890
Yes. Please raise your arms.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.870
This place is getting more lively.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:41.150
The Get Wet Strategy was a resounding success!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.130
Enjoy.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.480
Yeah, seriously.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:46.990
She's so boring.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:52.990
<i>I remember them from middle school...</i>

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.040
Middle School Fair

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.120
Um, can I help o—

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.190
Great timing!

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:01.040
Can I have your apron?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:02.870
Huh? Sure.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:03.630
Thanks.

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.820
Kei, I found an apron!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.440
Let's do this, girls!

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.010
Okay.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:28.540
You tryin' to ditch work here?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.520
N-No I'm not!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.120
And anyway, aren't you ditching wo—

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.650
You two!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.620
No lazing around! Get changed.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.910
There's work to be done.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:44.030
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:48.050
The next duel will be between the resident superpowers!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:52.550
She wields her guns as one would a rice ball and kills without hesitation!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.670
Our president, Sonora!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.510
What am I, a hitman?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:02.140
Facing her is our newest member, having left the impact of a meteor!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.730
She's a very serious person deep down, but also a bit of an airhead.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.860
Storms follow in her wake!

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.970
Yura, tenth grade!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.660
This is so embarrassing.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.090
Who will hit first?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.770
This is our quick draw duel!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:20.290
Come closer! Watch!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.620
Lady Luck is fickle!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:28.770
I wonder who's going to win.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:31.080
My money's on Sonora.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:34.980
I mean, she holds the quick draw record with 200ms.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.370
I see.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.890
That's going to be a sight indeed.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.700
<i>They're gone.</i>

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.930
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:53.400
<i>Oh, isn't this my first time facing her?</i>

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.780
<i>There's no way I'll win.</i>

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:58.660
<i>But maybe...</i>

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.010
Yura...

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.020
No, stop!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:34.900
Caref—

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:39.410
Sneaky sumbitch!

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:49.420
Yura has won!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.580
I did it!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.710
Applaud her, ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.060
Is the girl okay?

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.130
Yeah.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.230
That's her there.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.430
Sono!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.520
I...

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.580
Sure, hold on a sec.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.530
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.820
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.030
I'm amazed you won, Yura!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.780
Sono ain't easy to beat.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.310
It's just water guns, though.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.080
Thanks.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.570
I didn't know Stella had such a good shot.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.480
The tournament will be a lot of fun, don't you think?

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.680
How long are you gonna keep wearing that, Daishichi?

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.640
I sorta like it.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.830
Are you sure about this?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.180
The teachers won't like it.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:54.540
We're cool.

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:56.630
This is the best spot.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:58.780
Whoah, you're right!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.160
It's starting, girls.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.740
It's beautiful.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:17.290
Yeah.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:32.940
I ran some calculations earlier, and it looks like we can afford the 24-hour tournament.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:35.130
Really?

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.400
For real, we've gotta set up shop somewhere.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.940
A firing range café would rock!

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.240
I'd be the manager, then.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.890
Someone has to make sure there's enough tea.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.620
Then I'll, uh...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:47.700
I'll clean.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.150
There's nobody better than Honoka at accounting.

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:52.960
I'll take care of fundraising!

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.520
Employees get all-you-can-drink and all-you-can-shoot, right?

00:19:56.520 --> 00:20:01.260
No, no. Everyone has to pay and do their part.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.740
That's so stingy.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.980
So how's that different from what we do now?

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.020
I...

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:18.360
I'm really glad I joined the C3 club.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.100
Damn right you are!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.740
Ouch...

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.000
Yesterday was a lot of fun.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.140
Totally!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.420
I wish there were a fair every day!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.980
I could do without the cleaning.

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.360
No slacking off now!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.340
You have to bring this back, right?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.710
Let's have some fun with it while it's here.

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:10.730
I agree!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.220
It's not working.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:16.530
You serious?

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.510
What the hell?!

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:27.760
I guess it was hit by our water guns yesterday.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:31.420
If it's just wet, we can dry all the cables and fix it.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.770
Do you want to dry this pipe thing too?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:35.980
A cockroach!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:40.820
There's a cockroach!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.750
The shooting machine!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.880
The roach is in there!

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.860
Hold it!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.240
It's not there!

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.240
Don't rip off the vinyl!

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:53.700
Here!

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:56.120
The shooting machine...

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.100
Command!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:12.970
Control!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.230
Communication!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.270
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:16.890
Yay!

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:20.110
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:23.440
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:28.570
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.660
Yay!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.790
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:38.620
but that's fine

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:41.750
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:42.750
Ready?

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.260
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.300
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:52.010
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.100
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.020
All right?

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:58.640
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:01.980
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.820
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:11.910
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.620
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:14.160
Okay!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:18.620
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.750
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:25.840
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:31.890
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.930
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:35.810
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.850 --> 00:24:09.630
Preview

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.570
Yamato Yura...

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:43.430
Isn't she a tragic heroine?

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:44.160
Heroine?

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:46.370
I'm the heroine! Right?

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:48.100
Are you?

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:51.220
How can I drag her down from her throne?

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:52.120
I know!

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:53.120
Aira, shoot me!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:55.590
That makes me the tragic heroine!

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:57.650
There's so many things wrong with that.

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:00.000
I shall do the deed myself!

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:00.510
Next time.

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:09.630
An assassin's bullet hath slain my comrade.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.520
An assassin's bullet hath slain my comrade.
